            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-39266\"><b>Laurey 39266, Swirl Foundry Cabinet Knob in Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith its rustic charm, the Foundry Oil Rubbed Bronze Cabinet Knob is the ideal farmhouse kitchen hardware. The Swirl Foundry Cabinet Knob in Oil Rubbed Bronze comes packaged with the mounting hardware. This kitchen cabinet pull has a 1-1/4 inch diameter and a 1 inch projection. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Foundry\">Laurey Foundry Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 39266 Oil Rubbed Bronze Foundry Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Oil Rubbed Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available finishes:</b>\r\n<table width=\"450\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-39266\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-39266-SM.jpg?v=1704354588\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-39266\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/foundry-matte-black-cabinet-knob-laurey-39220\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-39220-SM.jpg?v=1704354588\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-39220\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/foundry-antique-pewter-cabinet-knob-laurey-39206\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-39206-SM.jpg?v=1704354588\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-39206\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"text\" align=\"center\">\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-39266\"><b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/foundry-matte-black-cabinet-knob-laurey-39220\"><b>Matte Black</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/foundry-antique-pewter-cabinet-kn